//用于每秒施展一次的脚本，建议对Player1-6施加的调整放在这里

//SY#SECOND每秒计数一次SY#COUNT，每秒具体施法跟在这段后面
IF
	!GlobalTimerNotExpired("SY#SECOND","LOCALS")
THEN
	RESPONSE #100
		SetGlobalTimer("SY#SECOND","LOCALS",1)
		IncrementGlobal("SY#COUNT","LOCALS",1)
		Continue()
END
//新增施法须判断!GlobalTimerNotExpired("SY#SECOND","LOCALS")。施法后不需要加SetGlobalTimer("SY#SECOND","LOCALS",1)但一定要加Continue()，以控制每秒1次施法

